                <p>
                    <person sex="female" role="employee">
                        <occupation>Hushållerska</occupation>
                    </person> samt <person sex="female" role="employee">
                        <occupation>kökspiga</occupation>
                    </person> erhålla plats den <date when="1906-04-24" type="begin">24 April</date> å <placeName type="employment">Rönnebergs Gård</placeName>, <placeName type="employment" ref="#tagarp">Tågarp</placeName>. <ref type="reference">Goda rekommendationer</ref> erfordras. <person sex="female" role="application">Ebba Mark, f. von Geijer</person>.</p>
